From 6118bf97cc99d51d7e13209a1abd92916434f299 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 12 Aug 2026 16:30:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Redesign roles to Super Admin / ROP / Sotuv menejeri

Replaces manager/rep with rop/sotuv_menejeri across auth, RLS-adjacent
client scoping, and the UI. Company creation now sets both a Super
Admin and a ROP account; ROP's reports are linked via profiles.manager_id
(set by the platform owner). AmoCRM sync auto-provisions missing reps
with their AmoCRM email as login and a shared password ("12345678").

Scoping is enforced at the client-hook layer (useVisibleOwnerIds), the
same trust model the app already used for the old "rep" role: sotuv
menejeri sees only their own leads/deals/tasks/calls everywhere except
Reyting (company-wide ranking, by design) and Normativ (same-ROP
teammates); rop sees their own team only; super_admin is unrestricted.
Also fixes two pre-existing RLS bugs on the same surface (stray
ai_agents/auto_responders policies, a reopened notification_preferences
leak) and a bug where the Leaderboard silently only showed the caller's
own profile row due to an overly restrictive profiles_select policy.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
